# What `gcloud run deploy --source .` uploads. Keep it to the Docker build inputs (deploy/Dockerfile):
# Go sources, web/, docs/, research/*.md, fixtures/. Note research/**/*.md and docs/agent-system-prompt.md
# are bundled into the SPA, so only research's binary sources are excluded.
.git
.gitignore
.gcloudignore
.github
.claude
design
harness
research/sources
node_modules
**/node_modules
web/dist
web/public/engine.wasm
web/public/wasm_exec.js
**/.DS_Store
